sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant M as SplitOS Manager
    participant R as Runtime Host
    participant B as System Browser
    participant A as SplitOS Authorization Server
    participant API as SplitOS Account Backend
    participant S as DPAPI Secret Store

    U->>M: Sign in / Create account
    M->>R: Auth.Start
    R->>R: Create state + nonce + PKCE S256
    R->>R: Bind 127.0.0.1 ephemeral listener
    R->>B: Open authorization URL
    B->>A: Authorization request
    A-->>B: User login / consent
    A-->>R: Loopback callback(code, state)
    R->>R: Validate state / transaction
    R->>A: Exchange code + code_verifier
    A-->>R: Access token + rotated refresh token + ID token
    R->>R: Validate issuer/aud/nonce/sub
    R->>API: GET /v1/account
    API-->>R: accountId + profile
    R->>API: GET /v1/entitlements/current
    API-->>R: FREE/PRO capabilities + version
    R->>S: DPAPI protect refresh token
    S-->>R: Durable protected blob
    R->>R: Persist Windows user association
    R->>R: Recompute ManagedRuntimeAccessDecision
    R-->>M: Account + entitlement projection

    alt PRO and offline eligible
        R->>API: POST offline assertion request
        API-->>R: signed bounded assertion
        R->>S: Replace protected blob with assertion
    end

    alt Upgrade from FREE
        U->>M: Upgrade
        M->>R: Checkout.Create
        R->>API: POST checkout session
        API-->>R: checkoutUrl + checkoutSessionId
        R->>B: Open hosted checkout
        B-->>API: Payment/provider flow completes via backend
        R->>API: Poll/refresh checkout + entitlement
        API-->>R: New entitlementVersion + PRO capabilities
        R->>R: Recompute access
        R-->>M: PRO activated
    end